{"ordinal":15134,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452199358467","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Death_070aedd","source":"Wifefema: На тебя нет…","target":"Wifefema: Ție ți-ar trebui…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-382.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15135,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452199358466","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Death_0b3f6e0","source":"Wifefema: Вот ты баклан. Муженька моего…","target":"Wifefema: Ce prostănac ești. Pe soțul meu…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-382.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15136,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452199358465","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Ears_DontShoot_0c7656e","source":"Wifefema: Женщина. Человек. А ты… Ты тут с пушкой стоишь, зверьё из меня делаешь. Интересно, самому-то не страшно, кем ты стал?","target":"Wifefema: Femeie. Om. Iar tu… Stai aici cu pușca și faci din mine o fiară. Nu te sperie oare în ce te-ai transformat?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-382.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15137,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452199358464","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Ears_DontShoot_0135f07","source":"Wifefema: Мелочи, они ведь важны. Вот серьга, например, напоминает мне, кто я есть.","target":"Wifefema: Mărunțișurile contează. Uite, cercelul ăsta, de pildă, îmi amintește cine sunt.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-382.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15138,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452195164172","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Photo_DontShoot_0b2722e","source":"Wifefema: Ой, боюсь-боюсь, фотография меня разоблачила! Ха! А ты сам-то, небось, так дрожишь, что вот-вот на курок нажмёшь. Не боишься ошибиться, судья ты наш?","target":"Wifefema: Vai, ce frică mi-e, m-a dat de gol fotografia! Ha! Dar tu probabil tremuri atât de tare, că mai ai puțin și apeși pe trăgaci. Nu ți-e teamă că vei greși, judecătorule?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-382.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15139,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452195164171","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Armpit_DontShoot_06b69b9","source":"Wifefema: Мужчины любят говорить, что женщинам нужно следить за собой. А мне плевать, мне бы в КЧС попасть, а не о таких глупостях думать.","target":"Wifefema: Bărbații tot spun că femeile trebuie să aibă grijă cum arată. Mie nu-mi pasă. Vreau să intru în Comitet, nu să-mi bat capul cu asemenea prostii.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-382.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15140,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452195164170","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Eyes_DontShoot_0e75632","source":"Wifefema: В КЧС бы взяли – вот бы делов-то натворила! Гостей от людей отличала бы за километр, да и с такими, как ты, у меня был бы разговор короткий.","target":"Wifefema: De m-ar primi în Comitet, ai vedea ce-aș face! Aș deosebi Musafirii de oameni de la un kilometru, iar cu unii ca tine aș termina repede discuția.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-382.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15141,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452195164169","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Hands_DontShoot_022b3c0","source":"Wifefema: Вот бы и тебе какую-нибудь работу найти… например, пыль подметать зубами.","target":"Wifefema: Ți-ar prinde bine și ție un serviciu… de pildă, să mături praful cu dinții.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-382.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15142,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452195164168","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Hands_DontShoot_0900df6","source":"Wifefema: Руки у меня рабочие. Не для красоты, а для дела.","target":"Wifefema: Am mâini de muncitoare. Nu-s de frumusețe, ci de treabă.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-382.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15143,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452195164167","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Teeth_DontShoot_0c82f30","source":"Wifefema: Хех, ты ж не думаешь, что у тебя они останутся целыми, если будешь и дальше себя так вести?","target":"Wifefema: Heh, doar nu crezi că mâinile tale vor rămâne întregi dacă te porți așa în continuare?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-382.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15144,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452195164166","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Teeth_DontShoot_0970653","source":"Wifefema: Ну, зубы – это гордость женщины. А вот кровь… Ну, с кем не бывает.","target":"Wifefema: Ei, dinții sunt mândria unei femei. Iar sângele… Se mai întâmplă.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-382.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15145,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452195164165","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Ears_Gun_096f49c","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15146,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452195164164","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Ears_Gun_050d468","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15147,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452195164163","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Ears_Gun_0bfaf43","source":"Wifefema: Ты что, против серёжек что-то имеешь? Не понравилась?","target":"Wifefema: Ce, ai ceva împotriva cerceilor? Nu ți-a plăcut?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-382.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15148,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452195164162","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Photo_Gun_011fb33","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15149,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452195164161","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Photo_Gun_0648f29","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15150,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452195164160","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Photo_Gun_03f497c","source":"Wifefema: Это извращенство, что ли, какое-то? Или настолько испугался моего муженька???","target":"Wifefema: Ce-i asta, vreo perversiune? Sau te-a speriat atât de tare soțiorul meu???","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-382.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15151,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452190969867","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Armpit_Gun_0084976","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15152,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452190969866","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Armpit_Gun_0321ae1","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15153,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452190969865","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Armpit_Gun_04a6f54","source":"Wifefema: Хах, вот доберётся до тебя мой муженёк. Давай-ка не дури!","target":"Wifefema: Ha, lasă că ajunge soțiorul meu la tine. Nu mai face prostii!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-382.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15154,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452190969864","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Armpit_Gun_018cb2b","source":"Wifefema: Чего в меня ружьём тыкать?","target":"Wifefema: De ce îndrepți pușca spre mine?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-382.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15155,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452190969863","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Armpit_Gun_0103685","source":"Wifefema: Ты лучше его найди и спроси, чем меня наградили!","target":"Wifefema: Mai bine găsește-l pe el și întreabă-l cu ce m-am pricopsit!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-382.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15156,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452190969862","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Eyes_Gun_0ce68ce","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15157,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452190969861","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Eyes_Gun_0c56d3a","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15158,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452190969860","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Eyes_Gun_0df1876","source":"Wifefema: Давай-ка, убирай эту игрушку, и дальше займёмся своими обязанностями.","target":"Wifefema: Hai, lasă jucăria aia jos și să ne vedem mai departe de treburile noastre.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-382.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15159,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452190969859","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Eyes_Gun_06acb49","source":"Wifefema: Глаза тебе не понравились? Ха, ну ты даёшь!","target":"Wifefema: Nu ți-au plăcut ochii mei? Ha, ce idei ai!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-382.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15160,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452190969858","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Eyes_Gun_07b2506","source":"Wifefema: Глаза недостаточно белые? Ха, ну ты даёшь!","target":"Wifefema: Ochii mei nu-s destul de albi? Ha, ce idei ai!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-382.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15161,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452190969857","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Hands_Gun_09ab192","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15162,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452190969856","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Hands_Gun_0eb1f70","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15163,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452186775563","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Hands_Gun_055a9c8","source":"Wifefema: Ой, да брось ты! Чем тебе ногти мои не угодили?","target":"Wifefema: Hai, las-o baltă! Ce-ai cu unghiile mele?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-382.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15164,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452186775562","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Teeth_Gun_010ae11","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15165,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452186775561","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Teeth_Gun_05b7cfa","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15166,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452186775560","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Teeth_Gun_09c1e45","source":"Wifefema: Эй-эй, ты чего? Я тебе зубки показала, а ты мне стволом в рожу тычешь?","target":"Wifefema: Hei, ce faci? Ți-am arătat dinții, iar tu îmi bagi țeava puștii în față?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-382.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
