{"ordinal":15174,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452186775552","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Photo_05b4c9f","source":"Wifefema: Ну? Обычное, ага? Хех, а ты думал, там что-то особенное будет?","target":"Wifefema: Ei? Obișnuit, nu? Heh, credeai că o să găsești ceva deosebit?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-383.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15175,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452182581259","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Photo_0214c50","source":"Wifefema: ...","target":"Wifefema: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-383.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15176,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452182581258","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Photo_0bd28cb","source":"Wifefema: Хорошо. Только муженьку моему не показывай, хихи.","target":"Wifefema: Bine. Numai să nu-i arăți soțiorului meu, hihi.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-383.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15177,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452182581257","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Armpit_0f05daa","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
