{"ordinal":15179,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452182581255","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Armpit_0a90fd3","source":"Wifefema: Я тут не на подиуме, мне удобство важнее.","target":"Wifefema: Nu-s la prezentare de modă, comoditatea contează mai mult pentru mine.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-383.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15180,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452182581254","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Armpit_068a65d","source":"Wifefema: Чем это таким он меня заразил, падла?","target":"Wifefema: Cu ce m-a infectat nenorocitul?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-383.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15181,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452182581253","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Armpit_019c86b","source":"Wifefema: Я на прощание мужа обняла, а через день как начало чесаться.","target":"Wifefema: Mi-am îmbrățișat soțul la despărțire, iar a doua zi a început să mă mănânce pielea.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-383.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15182,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452182581252","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Armpit_0ac1091","source":"Wifefema: ...","target":"Wifefema: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-383.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15183,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452182581251","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wifefema_Armpit_03d68e4","source":"Wifefema: Хех, а вот это что за интерес у тебя? Ну, давай, смотри, не стесняйся.","target":"Wifefema: Heh, de unde interesul ăsta al tău? Hai, uită-te, nu fi timid.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-383.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
